description: Regenerate route catalog and OpenAPI metadata when only routes change.
globs: src/domains/**/*.routes.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

## Route catalog sync

When any `*.routes.ts` file is created or modified, run the **route-change** chain in its order —
the `src/domains/**/*.routes.ts` row of [`agent-os/docs/skill-triggers.md`](../docs/skill-triggers.md), generated from `agent-os/skills/chains.json` (this
rule keeps no copy of the steps). This rule's own step, **be-route-catalog**
(`agent-os/skills/be-route-catalog/SKILL.md`): run `pnpm routes:catalog` once, and
`pnpm docs:generate:multilang` when operation text changed.

CI enforces drift via `pnpm routes:catalog:check`.
